# Troubleshooting Checklist — Basic PC & Connectivity

Checklist for when a user reports a PC or network issue.

1. Gather problem info: user error, screenshots, exact time.
2. Reproduce the issue (ask permission).
3. Check physical connections & power.
4. Verify network (Wi-Fi icon, try ping 8.8.8.8).
5. Restart app / browser / PC.
6. Check Windows Event Viewer / macOS Console for errors.
7. Update drivers and OS if needed (note changes).
8. Document steps taken and outcome.
9. If unresolved, escalate with logs and screenshots.
